      "sourceUrl": "https://tropica.com/en/plants/plantdetails/Cryptocoryneundulata'BroadLeaf'(110A)/4566",
      "html": "<p>The triploid variety of Cryptocoryne undulata from Sri Lanka has wider leaves and a beautiful, flecked leaf pattern.</p><p>It also grows larger, from 15-30 cm, and the single rosette becomes 10-20 cm wide. It is a hardy plant and does well under many growing conditions.</p>"
